<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>HttpRunner - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/HttpRunner/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:40:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/HttpRunner/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>HttpRunner 的测试用例分层机制（适用于 2.X）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-testcase-layer-2x/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-testcase-layer-2x/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-2.0-release"&gt;《HttpRunner 2.0 正式发布》&lt;/a&gt;中提到，HttpRunner 从 2.0 版本开始，对测试用例组织形式进行了较大的调整，更正了之前在自动化测试概念上的偏差。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HttpRunner 2.0 正式发布</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-v2-release/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jan 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-v2-release/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在 2017 年 6 月份的时候我写了一篇博客，&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-api-test-best-practice/"&gt;《接口自动化测试的最佳工程实践（ApiTestEngine）》&lt;/a&gt;，并同时开始了 ApiTestEngine（HttpRunner 的前身）的开发工作。转眼间一年半过去了，回顾历程不禁感慨万千。HttpRunner 从最开始的个人业余练手项目，居然一路迭代至今，不仅在大疆内部成为了测试技术体系的基石，在测试业界也有了一定的知名度，形成了一定的开源生态并被众多公司广泛使用，这都是我始料未及的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HttpRunner 实现 hook 机制</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-hook/</link><pubDate>Sat, 12 May 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-hook/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在自动化测试中，通常在测试开始前需要做一些预处理操作，以及在测试结束后做一些清理性的工作。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HttpRunner 再议参数化数据驱动机制</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-data-driven-refactor/</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Mar 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-data-driven-refactor/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-data-driven/"&gt;《HttpRunner 实现参数化数据驱动机制》&lt;/a&gt;一文中，我们实现了参数化数据驱动的需求，并阐述了其设计思路的演变历程和开发实现涉及的核心要素。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="问题及思考"&gt;&lt;span&gt;问题及思考&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e9%97%ae%e9%a2%98%e5%8f%8a%e6%80%9d%e8%80%83" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;经过一段时间的实际应用后，虽然参数化数据驱动的功能可以正常使用，但终究感觉不够优雅。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HttpRunner 实现参数化数据驱动机制</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-data-driven/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 Feb 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-data-driven/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;从 1.1.0 版本开始，数据驱动机制进行了较大的优化和调整。&#10;请参考：&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/httprunner-data-driven/"&gt;《HttpRunner 再议参数化数据驱动机制》&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在自动化测试中，经常会遇到如下场景：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HttpRunner 通过 skip 机制实现对测试用例的分组执行控制</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-skip-feature/</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Feb 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-skip-feature/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景介绍"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景介绍&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;近期，某位同学对&lt;code&gt;HttpRunner&lt;/code&gt;提了一个&lt;a href="https://github.com/HttpRunner/HttpRunner/issues/96" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;需求点&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HttpRunner 的测试用例分层机制（已过期）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-testcase-layer/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 Dec 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-testcase-layer/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;从版本 1.4 开始，测试用例分层机制已进行重新设计，本文内容不再适用。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在 &lt;code&gt;HttpRunner&lt;/code&gt; 中，测试用例引擎最大的特色就是支持 &lt;code&gt;YAML/JSON&lt;/code&gt; 格式的用例描述形式。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HttpRunner 的结果校验器优化</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-validator-optimization/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 Dec 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-validator-optimization/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在测试用例中，包含预期结果这么一项，用于辅助测试人员执行测试用例时判断系统的功能是否正常。而在自动化测试中，我们的目标是让测试用例自动执行，因此自动化测试用例中同样需要包含预期结果一项，只不过系统响应结果不再由人工来进行判断，而是交由测试工具或框架来实现。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HttpRunner 支持 HAR 意味着什么？</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-supports-HAR/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Nov 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/HttpRunner-supports-HAR/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;HttpRunner&lt;/code&gt;开始支持&lt;code&gt;HAR&lt;/code&gt;啦！！！&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;如果你还没有体会到这三个感叹号的含义，那们你可能对&lt;code&gt;HAR&lt;/code&gt;还不了解。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="har-是什么"&gt;&lt;span&gt;HAR 是什么？&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#har-%e6%98%af%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;HAR&lt;/code&gt;的全称为&lt;code&gt;HTTP Archive&lt;/code&gt;，是&lt;a href="https://www.w3.org/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;W3C(World Wide Web Consortium)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;发布的一个通用标准。简单地说，&lt;code&gt;HAR&lt;/code&gt;是一个约定的&lt;code&gt;JSON&lt;/code&gt;文件格式，用于记录&lt;code&gt;HTTP&lt;/code&gt;请求交互的所有内容，包括请求响应的详细记录和性能度量数据。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine 正式更名为 HttpRunner</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-rename-to-HttpRunner/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Nov 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-rename-to-HttpRunner/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-not-only-about-json-api/"&gt;《ApiTestEngine，不再局限于API的测试》&lt;/a&gt;一文的末尾，我提到随着&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;的发展，它的实际功能特性和名字已经不大匹配，需要考虑改名了。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;经过慎重考虑，最终决定将&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;正式更名为&lt;code&gt;HttpRunner&lt;/code&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="名字的由来"&gt;&lt;span&gt;名字的由来&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%90%8d%e5%ad%97%e7%9a%84%e7%94%b1%e6%9d%a5" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;为什么选择&lt;code&gt;HttpRunner&lt;/code&gt;这个名字呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine，不再局限于 API 的测试</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-not-only-about-json-api/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Nov 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-not-only-about-json-api/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;从编写&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-api-test-best-practice/"&gt;《接口自动化测试的最佳工程实践（ApiTestEngine）》&lt;/a&gt;至今，已经快半年了。在这一段时间内，&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;经过持续迭代，也已完全实现了当初预设的目标。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>约定大于配置：ApiTestEngine实现热加载机制</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-hot-plugin/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 Sep 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-hot-plugin/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://github.com/debugtalk/ApiTestEngine" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;中编写测试用例时，我们有时需要定义全局的变量，或者引用外部函数实现一些动态的计算逻辑。当前采用的方式是：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine 集成 Locust 实现更好的性能测试体验</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-supersede-locust/</link><pubDate>Sun, 27 Aug 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-supersede-locust/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/debugtalk/ApiTestEngine" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;不是接口测试框架么，也能实现性能测试？&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;是的，你没有看错，&lt;a href="https://github.com/debugtalk/ApiTestEngine" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;集成了&lt;a href="http://locust.io/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Locust&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;性能测试框架，只需一份测试用例，就能同时实现接口自动化测试和接口性能测试，在不改变&lt;a href="http://locust.io/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Locust&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;任何特性的情况下，甚至比&lt;code&gt;Locust&lt;/code&gt;本身更易用。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine QuickStart</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-quickstart/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Aug 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/apitestengine-quickstart/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="introduction-to-sample-interface-service"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Introduction to Sample Interface Service&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#introduction-to-sample-interface-service" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Along with this project, I devised a sample interface service, and you can use it to familiarize how to play with &lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine 演进之路（4）测试用例中实现 Python 函数的调用</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-4-call-functions-in-yaml-testcases/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Jul 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-4-call-functions-in-yaml-testcases/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-3-define-functions-in-yaml-testcases/"&gt;《测试用例中实现&lt;code&gt;Python&lt;/code&gt;函数的定义》&lt;/a&gt;中，介绍了在&lt;code&gt;YAML/JSON&lt;/code&gt;测试用例中实现&lt;code&gt;Python&lt;/code&gt;函数定义的两种方法，以及它们各自适用的场景。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;但是在&lt;code&gt;YAML/JSON&lt;/code&gt;文本中要怎样实现函数的调用和传参呢？&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;variables:&#10; - TOKEN: debugtalk&#10; - json: {}&#10; - random: ${gen_random_string(5)}&#10; - authorization: ${gen_md5($TOKEN, $json, $random)}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;例如上面的例子（YAML格式），&lt;code&gt;gen_random_string&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;gen_md5&lt;/code&gt;都是已经定义好的函数，但&lt;code&gt;${gen_random_string(5)}&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;${gen_md5($TOKEN, $json, $random)}&lt;/code&gt;终究只是文本字符串，程序是如何将其解析为实际的函数和参数，并实现调用的呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine 演进之路（3）测试用例中实现 Python 函数的定义</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-3-define-functions-in-yaml-testcases/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jul 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-3-define-functions-in-yaml-testcases/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-2-best-testcase-description/"&gt;《ApiTestEngine 演进之路（2）探索优雅的测试用例描述方式》&lt;/a&gt;中，我们臆想了一种简洁优雅的用例描述方式，接下来，我们就从技术实现的角度，逐项进行深入讲解，将臆想变成现实。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine 演进之路（2）探索优雅的测试用例描述方式</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-2-best-testcase-description/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Jul 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-2-best-testcase-description/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-1-setup-basic-framework/"&gt;《ApiTestEngine 演进之路（1）搭建基础框架》&lt;/a&gt;一文中，我们完成了&lt;a href="https://github.com/debugtalk/ApiTestEngine" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;基础框架的搭建，并实现了简单接口的测试功能。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>300 行 Python 代码打造实用接口测试框架</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/300-lines-python-code-api-test-framework/</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Jun 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/300-lines-python-code-api-test-framework/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在刚开始实现&lt;a href="https://github.com/debugtalk/ApiTestEngine" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;的时候，&lt;a href="https://testerhome.com/kasi" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;卡斯（kasi）&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;提议做一个Java版的。对于这样的建议，我当然是拒绝的，瞬即回复了他，“人生苦短，回头是岸啊”。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine 演进之路（1）搭建基础框架</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-1-setup-basic-framework/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Jun 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-1-setup-basic-framework/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-0-setup-CI-test/"&gt;《ApiTestEngine 演进之路（0）开发未动，测试先行》&lt;/a&gt;一文中，我对&lt;a href="https://github.com/debugtalk/ApiTestEngine" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;项目正式开始前的准备工作进行了介绍，包括构建API接口服务（&lt;code&gt;Mock Server&lt;/code&gt;）、搭建项目单元测试框架、实现持续集成构建检查机制（&lt;a href="https://travis-ci.org/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Travis CI&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;）等。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ApiTestEngine 演进之路（0）开发未动，测试先行</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-0-setup-CI-test/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 Jun 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-0-setup-CI-test/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-api-test-best-practice/"&gt;《接口自动化测试的最佳工程实践（ApiTestEngine）》&lt;/a&gt;一文中，我详细介绍了&lt;a href="https://github.com/debugtalk/ApiTestEngine" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;诞生的背景，并对其核心特性进行了详尽的剖析。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;接下来，我将在《ApiTestEngine演进之路》系列文章中讲解&lt;a href="https://github.com/debugtalk/ApiTestEngine" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;是如何从第一行代码开始，逐步实现接口自动化测试框架的核心功能特性的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>接口自动化测试的最佳工程实践（ApiTestEngine）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-api-test-best-practice/</link><pubDate>Sun, 18 Jun 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/ApiTestEngine-api-test-best-practice/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;当前市面上存在的接口测试工具已经非常多，常见的如&lt;code&gt;Postman&lt;/code&gt;、&lt;code&gt;JMeter&lt;/code&gt;、&lt;code&gt;RobotFramework&lt;/code&gt;等，相信大多数测试人员都有使用过，至少从接触到的大多数简历的描述上看是这样的。除了这些成熟的工具，也有很多有一定技术能力的测试（开发）人员自行开发了一些接口测试框架，质量也是参差不齐。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>